</figure>
<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We presents supplementary plots for additional vision encoders, in a format consistent with <a href="#S5.T3.st2" title="In Table 3 ‣ 5.1 Setup ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Post-training quantization of vision encoders needs prefixing registers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3(b)</span></a>. <a href="#A3.T7.st2" title="In Table 7 ‣ Appendix C Image retrieval results ‣ Post-training quantization of vision encoders needs prefixing registers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7(b)</span></a> presents zero-shot image–text retrieval results on the MSCOCO dataset for OpenCLIP and SigLIP2. In both models, RegCache consistently achieves the highest retrieval accuracy as well.</p>
</div>
</section>
